# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Basics of Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-estimation-qpe}"
msgstr "3. Dasar-dasar Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-estimation-qpe}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Given a unitary operation $U$, the QPE estimates $\\theta$ in $U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ since $U$ is unitary, all of its eigenvalues have a norm of 1.\n"
msgstr "Diberikan operasi uniter $U$, QPE mengestimasi $\\theta$ dalam $U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ karena $U$ bersifat uniter, semua nilai eigennya memiliki norma 1.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3.1 Procedure {#31-procedure}"
msgstr "3.1 Prosedur {#31-procedure}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup {#1-setup}"
msgstr "1. Persiapan {#1-setup}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is in one set of qubit registers. An additional set of $n$ qubits form the counting register on which we will store the value $2^n\\theta$:\n"
msgstr "$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ berada dalam satu set register qubit. Satu set tambahan $n$ qubit membentuk register pencacah di mana kita akan menyimpan nilai $2^n\\theta$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Superposition {#2-superposition}"
msgstr "2. Superposisi {#2-superposition}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a $n$-bit Hadamard gate operation $H^{\\otimes n}$ on the counting register:\n"
msgstr "Terapkan operasi Hadamard gate $n$-bit $H^{\\otimes n}$ pada register pencacah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Controlled Unitary operations {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"
msgstr "3. Operasi Controlled Unitary {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We need to introduce the controlled unitary $CU$ that applies the unitary operator $U$ on the target register only if its corresponding control bit is $|1\\rangle$. Since $U$ is a unitary operator with eigenvector $|\\psi\\rangle$ such that $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, this means:\n"
msgstr "Kita perlu memperkenalkan controlled unitary $CU$ yang menerapkan operator uniter $U$ pada register target hanya jika bit kontrolnya adalah $|1\\rangle$. Karena $U$ adalah operator uniter dengan eigenvector $|\\psi\\rangle$ sedemikian sehingga $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, maka:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3.2 Example: T-gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"
msgstr "3.2 Contoh: T-gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's use $T$ gate as an example of QPE and estimate its phase $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita gunakan gate $T$ sebagai contoh QPE dan estimasi fasenya $\\theta$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We expect to find:\n"
msgstr "Kita harapkan menemukan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where\n"
msgstr "di mana\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"We initialize $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ of the eigenvector of $T$ gate by applying an $X$ gate:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"Kita menginisialisasi $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ dari eigenvector gate $T$ dengan menerapkan gate $X$:\n"

